<title>ITALY: Italy's ENEL interested in 3rd mobile phone net.</title>
<headline>Italy's ENEL interested in 3rd mobile phone net.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian electricity utility ENEL is interested in participating with Deutsche Telekom in the tender for the third mobile phone network in Italy, the group's chairman Chicco Testa said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The tender for the third network is expected to start in June and give added competition to the first two networks run by state-controlled Telecom Italia Mobile (TIM) and the Omnitel consortium.</p>
<p>Testa said that he did not rule out the entry of other partners in the bid. &quot;Those that have industrial capacity are welcome,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
